{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114082247729-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114094347\"/><p>觀塘游泳池有人遇溺。</p><p>觀塘游泳池有人遇溺。今日(14日)早上8時10分，一名女子在翠屏道2號觀塘泳池游泳期間懷疑遇溺，在場人士發現立即將女子救回岸上並施行急救。救護車接報到場將昏迷姓甄(68歲)事主送往聯合醫院治理，其遇溺原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T01:53:08.688721+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T00:22:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T16:00:31.171777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T01:46:23.820484+00:00","content_hash":"25c7cb62ad123b0ab28009b3739c2c5ec231c0ac8c10c31a6275549b621e1b12","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T01:53:08.688721+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}